{"id":2565,"date":"2017-10-19T10:50:48","date_gmt":"2017-10-19T17:50:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/?page_id=2565"},"modified":"2026-07-01T07:06:19","modified_gmt":"2026-07-01T14:06:19","slug":"contact","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/contact","title":{"rendered":"Contact Us"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0If you are contacting us for an <strong>urgent matter<\/strong>, please review below.<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For medical, fire or law enforcement assistance, call <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">911<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> .<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For EH&amp;S emergencies, including spills and after hours, call <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(650) 725-9999<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> .<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To report an incident (illness\/injury or close call) <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/su17.stanford.edu\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">click here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For all other <strong>non-urgent matters<\/strong>, please <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"mailto:ehswebteam@lists.stanford.edu\">email us here<\/a><\/span>. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">General information and questions: <\/span><a tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" data-cid=\"16057232263681338461\" data-rtid=\"i5XYqL8QpLdY\" data-ved=\"0ahUKEwjvpqKy8a_XAhXJhVQKHVQ6CIwQyTMIJTAA\">(650) 723-0448<\/a><\/p>\n<p>For questions around <strong>hazardous materials management &amp; environmental support<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/stanford.service-now.com\/facilities_services?id=sc_cat_item&amp;sys_id=ba2d7c933ba166d079a53434c3e45a93\">please use this form<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Environmental Health &amp; Safety<br \/>\n484 Oak Road<br \/>\nStanford CA 94305<\/p>\n<p><b>Please do not use this form to submit any personal health information or other high risk data.<\/b><\/p>\n<div id=\"#triage-container\" style=\"padding: 2rem; background-color: #f8f5f3;\">\n<h2>Not sure if you&#8217;re in the right place?<\/h2>\n<h3>Go <a href=\"\/report-safety-concern\">here<\/a> for hazard reporting (anonymous option)<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use the <\/span><a href=\"\/report-safety-concern\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">EH&amp;S Hazard Reporting Form<\/span><\/a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">to report non-urgent hazards.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you need to report anonymously, please <a href=\"https:\/\/uco.stanford.edu\/helpline\">go here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3>Go <a href=\"http:\/\/su17.stanford.edu\">here<\/a> to report an incident<\/h3>\n<p>To report an incident or close-call, submit an <a href=\"http:\/\/su17.stanford.edu\">Incident Report (SU-17) here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Call <a class=\"c-link\" href=\"tel:8002161784\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-stringify-link=\"tel:8002161784\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\">800-216-1784<\/a> for Stanford Health Care safety concerns<\/h3>\n<p>This form is not for Stanford Health Care Safety. Please call the Compliance and Privacy 24-hour Hotline at 800-216-1784, including making anonymous reports, or email your concern to <a class=\"c-link\" href=\"mailto:ComplianceOfficer@stanfordhealthcare.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-stringify-link=\"mailto:ComplianceOfficer@stanfordhealthcare.org\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\">ComplianceOfficer@stanfordhealthcare.org<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u00a0If you are contacting us for an urgent matter, please review below. For medical, fire or law enforcement assistance, call 911 . For EH&amp;S emergencies, including spills and after hours, call (650) 725-9999 . To report an incident (illness\/injury or close call) click here. For all other non-urgent matters, please email us here. General information [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2565","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","wpautop"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2565","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2565"}],"version-history":[{"count":48,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2565\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":24275,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2565\/revisions\/24275"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2565"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2565"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ehs.stanford.edu\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=2565"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}